Package: log2ram-guard
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Jan Wiebe Klijnsma <jwklijnsma@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: bash, coreutils, findutils, util-linux, systemd
Recommends: log2ram
Homepage: https://github.com/jwklijnsma/log2ram
Description: keep the log2ram tmpfs below a maximum usage
 Systemd timer that keeps /var/log (log2ram) below a usage threshold
 (default 65%) by vacuuming the journal, removing rotated logs, releasing
 deleted-but-open files and shrinking the largest logs. Also caps the
 journald size relative to the log2ram size.
